  "body": "Currently the SharedWorker constructor can throw due to secure contexts. However, this requires synchronous interprocess communication, as far as I can tell. (Currently that whole algorithm requires it, but it seems plausible that we remove the synchronous interprocess communication to the steps run in parallel, but that would not be possible with an exception.)\n\n@mikewest @bzbarsky \n\nRaised in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1560#issuecomment-249334313.\n",
